        },
        {
          "text": "Pick seven views",
          "sub": "four sides, top, bottom, trunk",
          "say": "Pick seven views: four sides, top, bottom, and a slice of the trunk."
        },
        {
          "text": "Bin points into pixels",
          "sub": "tree fills the frame",
          "say": "Project each view straight on, scale the tree to fill the frame, and drop every point into a pixel."
        },
        {
          "text": "Fill three channels",
